{"version":1,"content":"<p>男團MIRROR將於12月在亞博舉行合共14場《MIRROR \"12 AS 1\" LIVE 2026》香港演唱會，慶祝成軍 8周年。</p><p>今年MIRROR共派了3首團歌上台，包括《ATTENTION》﹑《同往》﹑《Fight Club》，而這3首歌在叱咤903專業推介，均屬冠軍歌，亦是MIRROR最多冠軍團歌的1年。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.378083+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T11:54:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.128881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536855+00:00","content_hash":"1b4afcb906771eb3a34107014f74683656b4532f3235f697c4e6759411cc1330","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}